  "title": "SOUTH BOW ANNOUNCES SUCCESSFUL OPEN SEASON",
  "summary": "CALGARY, Alta. – May 29, 2026 – South Bow Corp. (TSX & NYSE: SOBO) (South Bow or the Company) announces the successful outcome of its open season, which closed on March 30, 2026, securing 20-year binding commitments for firm transportation service from Hardisty, Alta., to U.S. delivery points.",
